invariant: INV-36
file: tcp_nonblocking.h
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: tcp_nonblocking.h declares the client's driver, ch_record_init,
  ch_record_in and ch_record_out, in a ROLE=server object as well, which
  defines none of the three, so a server program that calls one compiles
  and then fails to link. matches.zig refuses to compile against the
  h2-server object, whose chapulin.c then declares three ch_ calls the
  object neither exports nor imports.

